WEBVTT

00:03.009 --> 00:07.509
<i>Morioh Radio, here,
ready with our next segment.</i>

00:07.847 --> 00:12.017
<i>"Help! Midnight Mentor!"</i>

00:12.393 --> 00:16.893
<i>Our first letter is from
"Forever 21, Pretty Baby."</i>

00:18.566 --> 00:20.484
<i>"Kai, get a load of this.</i>

00:21.027 --> 00:25.527
<i>I was late to my little rendezvous
again because of that thing.</i>

00:25.698 --> 00:28.158
<i>Yeah, the one by the station!</i>

00:28.868 --> 00:31.203
<i>The crossing that
never opens!</i>

00:31.371 --> 00:34.791
<i>Ugh, it just goes ding, ding, ding, ding,
ding, ding… It's so annoying!"</i>

00:37.210 --> 00:40.004
<i>Now, just take it easy, Pretty Baby.</i>

00:40.505 --> 00:41.255
Oh…

00:57.063 --> 00:59.398
JOJO'S BIZARRE ADVENTURE
DIAMOND IS UNBREAKABLE

01:00.692 --> 01:03.986
<i>These faceless gazes pass by one another</i>

01:04.362 --> 01:07.656
<i>A wound to the heart changes our everyday</i>

01:07.907 --> 01:12.407
<i>Encounters without boundaries
The bizarre is our normal U-yeh</i>

01:14.872 --> 01:18.208
<i>These ordinary mornings,
we're laughing on the surface</i>

01:18.293 --> 01:21.879
<i>Mysteries drawn to each other,
identity still unknown</i>

01:21.963 --> 01:26.463
<i>Without a heads up,
it's quietly lurking somewhere in this town</i>

01:31.097 --> 01:35.597
<i>Although we bicker and complain
In the end, we celebrate</i>

01:38.146 --> 01:41.524
<i>Dancing through the everyday</i>

01:41.607 --> 01:46.107
<i>Crazy Noisy Bizarre Town</i>

01:58.333 --> 01:59.542
See ya.

01:59.792 --> 02:00.626
You serious?

02:02.962 --> 02:06.924
EPISODE 7
TOSHIKAZU HAZAMADA (SHOW OFF)

02:03.004 --> 02:06.048
So we're not the only
Stand users at school?

02:06.507 --> 02:06.945
You got it. This is Toshikazu Hazamada,
a junior from Group-C.

02:11.554 --> 02:14.056
Apparently this Hazamada guy
got in a spat

02:14.265 --> 02:17.101
with his buddy over something
trivial right before spring.

02:17.769 --> 02:21.689
Seems he dissed his
favorite idol or anime or something.

02:22.357 --> 02:25.902
That night, all of a sudden, the friend
he was arguing with

02:26.194 --> 02:30.072
gouged out his own left eye
with a mechanical pencil.

02:31.783 --> 02:33.451
Crazy, right?

02:34.202 --> 02:37.163
Rumor has it, Hazamada's friend
uttered these words while in the hospital:

02:38.373 --> 02:42.873
"When I came to, I was staring at
my eyeball with the only eye I had left."

02:45.797 --> 02:48.466
So you're saying this guy ripped out

02:48.800 --> 02:51.302
his friend's left eye with
some kind of a Stand?

02:51.719 --> 02:55.597
Maybe that's what happened,
maybe not.

02:56.099 --> 02:58.935
Remember, the average person
can't see Stands.

02:59.560 --> 03:02.229
I don't know,
this all sounds fishy to me.

03:02.397 --> 03:03.648
What'd you say?!

03:04.148 --> 03:07.776
Josuke, you've got no right
to say that to me!

03:08.194 --> 03:10.029
I've got a real job now, y'know!

03:10.238 --> 03:11.781
Huh? You're actually working?

03:12.031 --> 03:13.115
'Course, Master Koichi!

03:13.741 --> 03:16.452
I landed myself a little gig in finance.

03:16.744 --> 03:18.120
Finance?

03:18.371 --> 03:21.165
You don't mean loan shark, do you?

03:21.416 --> 03:24.502
Well… Let's just say I'm
working with some good people!

03:26.045 --> 03:29.465
That's great,
but did you forget about this?

03:31.551 --> 03:32.802
Wait, Josuke!

03:33.428 --> 03:34.971
M-Master Koichi!

03:35.179 --> 03:36.597
You're going, too?

03:36.931 --> 03:39.099
Just let that jackass,
Josuke, take care of it.

03:40.017 --> 03:42.978
Something terrible's taking over my town.

03:44.105 --> 03:47.483
And if Morioh's in danger,
then Mom, Dad, Sis,

03:47.859 --> 03:50.820
and everyone else I care about
are in danger, too.

03:51.612 --> 03:53.697
I'm scared,
but something has to be done!

03:55.658 --> 03:56.408
W…

03:57.285 --> 03:58.995
Wow, what a gutsy thing to say.

03:59.245 --> 04:01.914
I'd expect nothing less from my hero!

04:03.249 --> 04:03.999
But…

04:05.084 --> 04:07.836
You'll have to excuse me
as I've got to go home now!

04:08.045 --> 04:09.755
Stay out of trouble, Master Koichi!

04:16.429 --> 04:17.471
Yeah, totally.

04:20.475 --> 04:22.143
He doesn't seem to be in here.

04:22.643 --> 04:27.143
But if that Hazamada guy can
act like nothing ever happened

04:28.191 --> 04:31.027
after digging out
his friend's eye with a pencil,

04:33.279 --> 04:35.823
then he must be one helluva creeper.

04:42.163 --> 04:43.247
HAZAMADA

04:43.623 --> 04:45.916
H-Hey, Josuke!

04:46.083 --> 04:48.335
I'm gonna take a quick look
through this guy's locker.

04:48.920 --> 04:50.296
Keep an eye out, Koichi.

04:50.546 --> 04:53.382
Give me some warning next time!

04:54.008 --> 04:56.427
All right… So he left his bag in here.

04:56.928 --> 04:59.388
So he's still at school. Be careful.

05:00.056 --> 05:00.806
R-Right.

05:03.351 --> 05:05.811
Looks like he's in
the tennis club and a manga fan.

05:07.688 --> 05:10.107
One thing's for sure,
this guy's got way too much shit.

05:10.650 --> 05:13.903
I don't see how that bow and arrow
could be in here…

05:15.404 --> 05:17.322
The hell is this wooden thing?

05:21.369 --> 05:22.119
A Sta—

05:23.037 --> 05:25.998
N-Nah… Looks like
it's an ordinary object.

05:26.165 --> 05:30.127
So he's got one of those wooden
mannequins they sell in art stores?

05:30.878 --> 05:32.421
That scared the crap out of me…

05:45.226 --> 05:45.976
Huh?!

05:50.940 --> 05:52.316
What? How?!

05:52.733 --> 05:54.776
As soon as I touched
the thing, it turned into me.

05:55.278 --> 05:56.988
Well, that pretty much proves it…

05:59.198 --> 06:00.991
Hazamada's a Stand user!

06:03.953 --> 06:05.037
Ah, great…

06:05.413 --> 06:08.707
Turning into yours truly…
That's quite the cheeky move, pal…

06:09.750 --> 06:12.169
You know the manga <i>Perman,</i> right?

06:12.253 --> 06:13.921
I-It speaks!

06:14.005 --> 06:16.090
It sounds and talks just like him!

06:16.632 --> 06:20.052
You know, the copy robot in <i>Perman?</i>

06:20.595 --> 06:22.096
Pretty useful, dontcha think?

06:22.597 --> 06:25.391
Makes you wish you had one,
am I right?

06:26.183 --> 06:28.226
Hey, Koichi…
What's this guy mumbling about?

06:28.769 --> 06:29.686
Who the hell's Perman?

06:30.646 --> 06:33.690
You don't know Perman?!
I'm shocked.

06:33.941 --> 06:35.567
You sure you're Japanese?

06:35.860 --> 06:36.652
All right, enough!

06:36.986 --> 06:39.029
I'll be asking the questions around here!

06:40.489 --> 06:41.239
M-My arm!

06:41.449 --> 06:42.199
Josuke!

06:43.534 --> 06:48.034
But my robot…
is one you won't want around.

06:50.625 --> 06:54.211
Once it copies you,
you'll be making all the same movements.

06:54.670 --> 06:57.089
Which means it's not a puppet.

06:57.632 --> 06:59.884
It's a puppet master!

07:02.136 --> 07:03.846
K-Koichi! Watch out!

07:12.146 --> 07:13.397
Koichi!

07:14.482 --> 07:16.859
And another one bites the dust…

07:17.401 --> 07:21.901
Oh, but I didn't touch him.
The culprit is you, his dear friend.

07:24.659 --> 07:26.327
It's shit like that…

07:26.952 --> 07:29.162
that really makes my blood boil.

07:29.830 --> 07:32.207
Making others do your dirty work,

07:32.708 --> 07:35.210
cause you don't have
the balls to do it yourself.

07:36.045 --> 07:38.714
Nothing makes me want
to kick ass more!

07:38.881 --> 07:40.465
Well, great. Tee-hee!

07:43.719 --> 07:45.554
Looks like you're out of range.

07:45.971 --> 07:49.391
If you can't get any closer,
neither can your Stand.

07:50.518 --> 07:53.521
In other words,
as long as I keep my distance,

07:53.771 --> 07:58.271
Josuke, you don't have
a prayer against me!

08:03.114 --> 08:05.157
My Stand's name is Show Off.

08:05.616 --> 08:08.243
Possessing the doll has given
my Stand physical form…

08:08.911 --> 08:12.748
Therefore any ordinary person can see it.

08:14.041 --> 08:15.917
Hazamada! You sneaky…

08:16.794 --> 08:18.420
My objective is simple:

08:18.838 --> 08:21.423
Beat Jotaro within an inch of his life,

08:21.590 --> 08:23.258
and make sure he
never returns to this town.

08:28.931 --> 08:30.849
Pathetic outsider…

08:31.892 --> 08:34.394
Snooping around and getting
in our business.

08:35.146 --> 08:38.023
Although I did hear
Jotaro's Star Platinum

08:38.107 --> 08:41.110
can stop time for
a couple of seconds.

08:41.569 --> 08:43.821
There's not a single
Stand user among us

08:43.904 --> 08:45.947
who can get anywhere close
to him.

08:47.700 --> 08:52.200
That is, Josuke, no one besides the Stand
that just copied you now!

08:54.415 --> 08:56.875
Time to render you unconscious,

08:57.460 --> 08:59.128
meddlesome McCoy!

09:04.675 --> 09:05.801
Squished it, huh?

09:06.135 --> 09:08.470
The sound is sublime, isn't it?

09:09.138 --> 09:13.600
Now, as long as you didn't sever the nerve,
you might be able to see again…

09:13.726 --> 09:15.811
If you're lucky.

09:16.270 --> 09:18.689
He'll be out for a while.

09:19.231 --> 09:20.649
Well, that was easy.

09:20.941 --> 09:22.651
All right! Carry my bag.

09:22.985 --> 09:25.195
It's time to hunt Jotaro.

09:27.156 --> 09:28.782
Piece of cake.

09:29.116 --> 09:31.827
I'm pretty sure Jotaro's hotel is…

09:32.912 --> 09:34.496
Uh…

09:34.914 --> 09:36.624
The Morioh Grand Hotel.

09:36.957 --> 09:38.625
Yeah, that's it.

09:47.426 --> 09:48.176
K-Koichi!

09:48.636 --> 09:49.386
Koichi!

09:51.138 --> 09:54.558
J-Josuke, are you okay?

09:55.184 --> 09:56.351
Fine, thanks…

09:57.061 --> 09:59.313
Man, you sure've got plenty of spunk.

09:59.688 --> 10:01.022
You're all busted up…

10:01.315 --> 10:03.650
And still managed
to get him with your Stand.

10:04.819 --> 10:06.153
What are you talking about?

10:06.529 --> 10:09.740
That's only because,
the moment you sent me flying,

10:09.824 --> 10:13.202
you healed my fractures
with Shining Diamond.

10:17.957 --> 10:18.874
And, uh…

10:19.416 --> 10:22.752
it'd be nice if you could heal
the injuries I got from breaking down

10:23.003 --> 10:25.255
the door and window, too.

10:26.590 --> 10:27.882
R-Right!

10:53.367 --> 10:55.369
<i>Hello, you've reached
the Morioh Grand Hotel.</i>

10:55.578 --> 11:00.078
Oh, uh, could you put me through
to Jotaro Kujo in Room 324?

11:01.333 --> 11:02.167
<i>Certainly</i>

11:04.461 --> 11:08.548
Come on! We've got to
tell Jotaro about that Stand!

11:09.383 --> 11:10.634
<i>Thank you for waiting.</i>

11:11.176 --> 11:13.761
<i>The line for Room 324 is busy</i>

11:14.597 --> 11:16.348
<i>Please try again later.</i>

11:17.099 --> 11:17.849
It's busy?

11:18.058 --> 11:18.933
What?!

11:19.268 --> 11:21.103
Of course! It must be the copy!

11:21.395 --> 11:23.855
It got a hold of him before I could!

11:26.025 --> 11:27.151
Are you sure, Josuke?

11:27.651 --> 11:30.320
There's another Stand user
at your school?

11:30.654 --> 11:33.948
<i>Yep! I'll fill you in at Morioh Station.</i>

11:34.575 --> 11:36.285
<i>Meet me at the square out in front.</i>

11:36.577 --> 11:38.203
<i>Fifteen minutes is all it takes.</i>

11:39.121 --> 11:39.871
Got it.

11:40.331 --> 11:42.124
See you in front of the station in fifteen.

11:45.169 --> 11:46.587
Easy as pie.

11:54.595 --> 11:56.471
Shit! He's not answering!

11:56.889 --> 11:57.973
He must've left!

11:58.349 --> 12:00.893
They must've baited Jotaro
to meet somewhere!

12:01.268 --> 12:02.018
Damn!

12:02.269 --> 12:04.229
All we can do now is go after the copy!

12:04.355 --> 12:07.358
I really couldn't tell you two apart!

12:07.691 --> 12:08.441
Yeah.

12:08.692 --> 12:10.360
Well, what really freaks me out

12:10.778 --> 12:13.030
are his fingers, not his face.

12:13.489 --> 12:16.783
How often do you catch a glimpse of
your own fingers compared with your face?

12:17.576 --> 12:20.370
I realized he'd copied
me down to my fingerprints.

12:22.164 --> 12:22.914
Oh!

12:22.998 --> 12:25.458
Josuke, you're early.

12:25.876 --> 12:27.002
Where's Master Koichi?

12:27.586 --> 12:29.045
H-Hazamada?!

12:29.421 --> 12:30.547
What are you doing here?

12:30.923 --> 12:33.133
Tamami Kobayashi?

12:34.593 --> 12:38.179
So you really have no idea
why we're hanging out together?

12:38.430 --> 12:40.515
N-No, I don't…

12:41.225 --> 12:43.268
No clue whatsoever?

12:43.519 --> 12:45.854
No! Why?!

12:46.397 --> 12:47.231
Well then…

12:47.773 --> 12:48.899
Good!

12:53.445 --> 12:54.195
Step on it.

12:59.326 --> 13:01.453
If we don't catch up
with Hazamada fast,

13:01.829 --> 13:03.121
Jotaro's gonna be in deep shit!

13:09.837 --> 13:11.713
SHOW OFF

13:13.048 --> 13:17.548
TIME TO MEETING: 9 MINUTES

13:14.591 --> 13:16.884
We can't let Jotaro meet the copy!

13:17.177 --> 13:18.178
It'll be a disaster!

13:18.470 --> 13:18.992
Yeah.

13:19.179 --> 13:21.014
I haven't figured out
a solution just yet.

13:21.348 --> 13:22.974
So for now, we run!

13:30.858 --> 13:32.192
Bye-bye, Josuke!

13:32.401 --> 13:33.860
See you tomorrow!

13:34.028 --> 13:35.195
Bye!

13:36.196 --> 13:37.322
Josuke!

13:37.698 --> 13:39.282
Bye, Josuke!

13:40.200 --> 13:43.328
Why the hell are they saying
goodbye only to you?

13:43.620 --> 13:46.914
No one ever says that to me!

13:48.542 --> 13:51.545
Whatever! Every girl in
this school is butt ugly, anyway!

13:52.755 --> 13:53.505
Josuke…

13:54.882 --> 13:56.300
Um, could you read this?

13:58.469 --> 13:59.970
B-Bye.

14:00.804 --> 14:02.806
What're you accepting notes
from her for?

14:03.057 --> 14:04.558
Tear that thing up now!

14:05.726 --> 14:09.771
Goddammit…
What the hell makes you so special?!

14:11.398 --> 14:13.483
What does it matter now?

14:13.859 --> 14:14.609
Wha…

14:14.777 --> 14:17.321
I don't think you have time
to dilly dally.

14:17.529 --> 14:19.656
How dare you speak to me that way?!

14:20.074 --> 14:21.617
Ow!

14:21.742 --> 14:24.327
You scraped your hand?
That was stupid.

14:24.578 --> 14:25.954
I'm wood, 'member?

14:26.330 --> 14:28.457
Shut up! Quit crowding me!

14:28.749 --> 14:30.792
<i>Dammit, he's really starting
to get under my skin.</i>

14:31.126 --> 14:33.253
<i>This always happens with my Stand</i>

14:33.796 --> 14:36.465
<i>Like when I copied my crush,
Junko, just the other day..</i>

14:36.882 --> 14:40.176
<i>She was a complete bitch!
I couldn't take it,</i>

14:40.260 --> 14:41.469
<i>so the whole thing was a flop.</i>

14:41.929 --> 14:45.599
<i>Is there no one halfway decent
on this miserable planet? Shit!</i>

14:46.183 --> 14:47.684
<i>Damn Josuke!</i>

14:47.976 --> 14:49.686
<i>I'll take care of that Jotaro first.</i>

14:50.104 --> 14:51.814
<i>I'll smash him to smithereens!</i>

14:53.524 --> 14:54.691
<i>This is gonna be good!</i>

14:59.154 --> 15:00.530
My motorcycle!

15:00.864 --> 15:01.906
He just ruined the coat!

15:01.990 --> 15:03.992
Damn, dumb-ass!

15:04.076 --> 15:05.494
He's dead!

15:05.577 --> 15:08.454
Hey, take it easy,
it was probably an accident.

15:08.539 --> 15:09.414
'Sides, he'll hear you.

15:09.748 --> 15:12.250
You think I care?!
I want him to hear me!

15:12.543 --> 15:14.419
Walking around like that…

15:14.586 --> 15:17.839
Asshole!
He looks like a dying cricket.

15:19.800 --> 15:21.968
That's a good one! I like it!

15:22.511 --> 15:24.888
Yeah? Think it was good, huh?

15:31.645 --> 15:32.854
Huh? What?

15:33.605 --> 15:35.189
Keep a grip on him, Show Off.

15:36.483 --> 15:38.985
I'll settle the score myself.

15:40.195 --> 15:42.488
Wh-What are you doing, you freak?

15:43.991 --> 15:47.285
Now don't worry yourself with
silly things like that.

15:47.369 --> 15:49.162
Relax, and I'll make sure

15:49.329 --> 15:52.582
you never have to open
that mouth again.

15:53.041 --> 15:55.793
S-Stop!

16:00.465 --> 16:01.382
A piece of glass?

16:07.681 --> 16:09.557
J-Josuke Higashikata?!

16:10.225 --> 16:12.810
Shit… And that shrimp, too?

16:13.312 --> 16:14.229
Hazamada!

16:14.354 --> 16:16.439
We finally caught up with you, asshole!

16:17.441 --> 16:19.151
<i>But did you forget?</i>

16:19.484 --> 16:22.153
<i>Come face to face with my Show Off,</i>

16:22.237 --> 16:25.865
<i>and become
an instant puppet, Josuke!</i>

16:26.200 --> 16:28.243
Control him, Show Off!

16:28.410 --> 16:29.160
Don't be so sure.

16:33.832 --> 16:35.416
Wha… What's happening…

16:36.376 --> 16:40.671
That shard wasn't for hitting you…

16:41.465 --> 16:44.259
It was to put it back in
its rightful place!

16:46.261 --> 16:47.845
M-My right hand!

16:48.388 --> 16:50.098
It turned back into wood!

16:50.474 --> 16:52.350
This isn't good, Hazamada!

16:52.684 --> 16:53.601
Settle down!

16:53.894 --> 16:55.604
Pretend you're resting your hand
in your pocket!

16:56.188 --> 16:56.980
No one will know!

16:57.981 --> 16:59.023
We've got a bigger problem…

16:59.399 --> 17:02.944
Jotaro should be almost at
the station by now!

17:03.528 --> 17:05.446
As much as I'd like to
get rid of Josuke…

17:05.864 --> 17:08.116
we don't have time
to go after him now!

17:08.492 --> 17:11.786
H-Hazamada! Wait for me!

17:13.247 --> 17:14.248
I see…

17:14.748 --> 17:16.541
So they're meeting in
front of the station.

17:16.875 --> 17:20.378
J-Josuke, we don't have
time to just hang around!

17:20.629 --> 17:24.090
That road they just took is
the fastest way to the station!

17:25.217 --> 17:29.554
And that's why I've got you, Koichi.

17:36.687 --> 17:39.356
Guess Josuke's run into some trouble.

17:40.983 --> 17:43.151
See Josuke anywhere?

17:43.443 --> 17:44.861
Nope.

17:45.279 --> 17:49.491
If I so much as glance at him,
he'll be my puppet in a flash.

17:49.783 --> 17:51.242
Don't worry!

17:53.620 --> 17:55.622
Hazamada! A train's coming.

17:56.832 --> 17:57.999
It's the crossing that
never lets you through!

17:58.625 --> 17:59.626
It'll cost us at least a minute or two…

17:59.960 --> 18:01.670
All right!
We cross through the station!

18:02.629 --> 18:04.922
NO CROSSING

18:06.550 --> 18:10.136
Even if he's caught up with us,
Josuke won't get past that train!

18:10.387 --> 18:11.513
One minute left!

18:11.847 --> 18:14.516
We're gonna make it
to the meeting spot first!

18:16.268 --> 18:17.310
I win!

18:19.062 --> 18:19.812
Huh?

18:23.483 --> 18:25.860
That's Josuke!

18:26.278 --> 18:28.029
Wh-What about the train?!

18:28.322 --> 18:30.198
Why's the crossing open?!

18:30.449 --> 18:31.700
Hazamada, look!

18:32.409 --> 18:36.287
Wh-What the hell kind of Stand is that?!

18:39.583 --> 18:40.333
Great!

18:40.542 --> 18:44.337
Ya see? That's why I've got you.

18:47.341 --> 18:48.884
Ah! There he is!

18:50.218 --> 18:53.596
J-Jotaro! It's me, Josuke!

18:54.264 --> 18:55.056
Hey.

18:55.223 --> 18:56.641
We made it!

18:56.725 --> 18:59.853
We got Hazamada good,
didn't we, Josuke?

19:00.687 --> 19:01.646
Something happen?

19:09.529 --> 19:10.279
A copy?

19:10.822 --> 19:12.990
A Stand that copied you
down to your fingerprints?

19:13.575 --> 19:14.576
Yes!

19:14.868 --> 19:18.162
Had he arrived before us,
who knows what would've happened?

19:18.538 --> 19:20.748
But now we can relax.

19:20.957 --> 19:23.751
That copying bastard's missing
his hand, so it'll be easy.

19:24.336 --> 19:26.546
I made sure to do
a number on his right hand.

19:26.880 --> 19:28.256
You can use that to tell us apart.

19:28.799 --> 19:29.549
All right.

19:30.008 --> 19:32.135
They should be here any moment now.

19:35.055 --> 19:37.307
<i>Huh? What am I doing with this?</i>

19:38.225 --> 19:41.853
<i>Why did I take a pen
out of Jotaro's pocket?</i>

19:45.023 --> 19:46.566
<i>I-I can't move!</i>

19:46.900 --> 19:48.610
<i>My arm just stopped moving!</i>

20:01.790 --> 20:03.958
<i>The other side of the glass…</i>

20:04.626 --> 20:06.544
<i>Th-That's…</i>

20:11.550 --> 20:13.593
Josuke Higashikata…

20:14.010 --> 20:17.930
You're gonna plunge that pen
into Jotaro's brain,

20:18.014 --> 20:20.725
killing him instantly!

20:20.976 --> 20:25.476
After all, if he's left alive,
your Shining Diamond will only heal him.

20:27.774 --> 20:31.360
Josuke!
Your meddling is the cause of all this!

20:31.445 --> 20:35.945
I was only going to beat Jotaro up
and chase him out of town.

20:37.576 --> 20:41.371
But now,
Jotaro's gonna die by your hand!

20:41.580 --> 20:43.748
This whole thing is your fault!

20:50.964 --> 20:51.756
Now!

20:52.132 --> 20:55.176
Slaughter him, Show Off!

20:56.344 --> 20:57.720
<i>J- Jotaro…</i>

20:58.513 --> 20:59.388
Bastard!

21:01.766 --> 21:03.100
Something the matter, Josuke?

21:03.602 --> 21:04.936
Huh? No…

21:06.104 --> 21:07.522
Fortunately for me,

21:07.606 --> 21:10.734
it looks like those guys
finally tracked down Hazamada.

21:13.111 --> 21:13.986
Little turd!

21:14.070 --> 21:16.238
It's just like that Josuke guy said…

21:16.323 --> 21:18.616
You were across
the overpass at the station.

21:18.742 --> 21:20.827
He's a real swell guy.

21:20.952 --> 21:23.579
He treated our wounds and,
how, I'll never know,

21:23.663 --> 21:25.247
he completely fixed 'em!

21:26.500 --> 21:30.212
I think it's time we paid
you back for your little stunt earlier.

21:30.420 --> 21:33.714
There's something out behind
the bathroom we've gotta show ya.

21:41.890 --> 21:44.934
Once it gets you,
that Stand is pretty scary.

21:45.602 --> 21:48.771
Well, suppose I should mutilate
this doll now.

21:49.523 --> 21:51.399
I could use a little pick-me-up.

22:01.159 --> 22:02.451
<i>Meanwhile, Tamami was…</i>

22:02.953 --> 22:04.454
<i>hospitalized, unbeknownst to everyone.</i>

22:16.633 --> 22:18.176
What a fool!

22:19.094 --> 22:21.262
My condolences.

23:38.340 --> 23:41.176
EPISODE 8
YUKAKO YAMAGISHI
FALLS IN LOVE, PART 1
